        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We will remain an emerging growth company until the earlier of (1) the last day of the fiscal year (a) following the fifth anniversary of the completion of our Initial Public Offering, (b) in which we have total annual gross revenue of at least $1.235 billion, or (c) in which we are deemed to be a large accelerated filer, which means the market value of our Ordinary Shares that are held by non-affiliates equals or exceeds $700,000,000 as of the end of that year’s second fiscal quarter, and (2) the date on which we have issued more than $1.0 billion in non- convertible debt during the prior three-year period.",
